@vallapidus ⁩ raised the concern that we might get into trouble with the police when I first surfaced the idea of running our own weekend stand in the streets. Had the opportunity to observed a police car drive past this stand this afternoon, the police did not even bother to turn his head the direction of the booth 

Guess not a concern anymore

I spent 8 minutes making this observation

